{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"Beeftext.Beeftext","latestVersion":"16.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"A text snippet management tool for Windows, inspired by TextExpander.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/xmichelo/Beeftext/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"A text snippet management tool for Windows, inspired by TextExpander.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/xmichelo/Beeftext/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Are you tired of repeatedly typing the same text over and over again?\n- The custom email signature you only use for your close friends.\n- The markdown snippet you use 5 times a day.\n- The text emoji you like so much (\\/) (°,,,°) (\\/).\nBeeftext is made for you. Beeftext allows you to define combos. A combo associates a short word that you are unlikely to type in a normal situation (a keyword) with a piece of long or complex text you often need to type (a snippet). From now on, every time you type the keyword, in any text area of any application that supports copy/paste (99.9% of them do), the combo is triggered and Beeftext automatically replaces the keyword with its associated snippet. Thanks to Unicode encoding, this text can be in any language, using any kind of characters, even exotic ones.","name":"Beeftext","packageUrl":"https://beeftext.org/","publisher":"beeftext.org","publisherUrl":"https://michelon.ch/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/xmichelo/Beeftext/releases/tag/v16.0","tags":["expander","snippets","text","text-expander","text-snippets"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一款 Windows 下的文本片段管理工具，灵感来自 TextExpander。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"你是否厌倦了重复输入相同的文字？\n- 只给好友使用的自定义电子邮件签名。\n- 每天使用 5 次的标记符片段。\n- 你非常喜欢的文字 emoji (\\/) (°,,,°) (\\/)。\nBeeftext 就是为你量身打造的。Beeftext 允许你自定义组合。组合将您在正常情况下不太可能输入的简短单词（关键词）与您经常需要输入的一段较长或复杂的文本（片段）联系起来。从现在起，每当您在任何支持复制/粘贴的应用程序（99.9% 的应用程序都支持）的任何文本区域中输入关键词时，组合就会被触发，Beeftext 就会自动将关键词替换为相关的片段。由于采用了 Unicode 编码，该文本可以是任何语言，使用任何类型的字符，甚至是外来字符。","tags":["扩展器","文本","文本扩展器","文本片段","片段"]}},"longDescription":"Are you tired of repeatedly typing the same text over and over again?\n- The custom email signature you only use for your close friends.\n- The markdown snippet you use 5 times a day.\n- The text emoji you like so much (\\/) (°,,,°) (\\/).\nBeeftext is made for you. Beeftext allows you to define combos. A combo associates a short word that you are unlikely to type in a normal situation (a keyword) with a piece of long or complex text you often need to type (a snippet). From now on, every time you type the keyword, in any text area of any application that supports copy/paste (99.9% of them do), the combo is triggered and Beeftext automatically replaces the keyword with its associated snippet. Thanks to Unicode encoding, this text can be in any language, using any kind of characters, even exotic ones.","name":"Beeftext","packageUrl":"https://beeftext.org/","publisher":"beeftext.org","publisherUrl":"https://michelon.ch/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/xmichelo/Beeftext/releases/tag/v16.0","tags":["expander","snippets","text","text-expander","text-snippets"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/16.0/app.json","detailSha256":"e3b71591d1cb61f4576f9aee6c066016ba116ef53aa7d5859d20b078ada480f5","releaseDate":"2022-12-31","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"16.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/15.0/app.json","detailSha256":"cb87822db3ed0c26126498f2dfad3e50a5005eb3ab44c43378487b9d073331da","releaseDate":"2022-11-16","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"15.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/14.0/app.json","detailSha256":"285bb05860b5e6b5475430fe5386c59127f4fa7e2689d9882d11c5798bcba0db","releaseDate":"2022-05-10","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"14.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/13.0/app.json","detailSha256":"e86d89b358a566